    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested under Sub section (1) of the Section 46 of the Sri Lanka Electricity Act, No. 20 of 2009(as amend), the Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka does hereby impose an annual levy in such amounts as are set outin Column II of the Schedule hereto, to be recovered from those licensees holding such licenses as are specified in thecorresponding entry in Column I of that schedule. The previous Gazette Notification published in the Extraordinary GazetteNo. 1861/38 on Thursday 08th May, 2014 is hereby revoked.",
